French lexical synsets in this file are derived from WOLF
(Wordnet Libre du Français), distributed in the Open Multilingual Wordnet
data repository:
https://github.com/omwn/omw-data/tree/406bf83b3c507a3d1f26e88252d5d66893fd36bf/wns/fra

Source file: wn-data-fra.tab
