Citation:
Benoit Sagot and Darja Fišer. 2008. Building a free French wordnet from
multilingual resources. Proceedings of LREC 2008, Marrakech, Morocco.

Regenerate the bundled index with:
    python scripts/build_nlp_data.py --download-wordnets

Or build it from a previously downloaded source file with:
    python scripts/build_nlp_data.py --wolf-source /path/to/wn-data-fra.tab
